For a real trip, try saving in the village then restoring.

On a particular microVAX running Ultrix 1.2, the game hangs when entering
the Caves. Faking a core dump signal then restoring seems to set things aright -
the game restores you inside of the caves.

Somehow, a frost demon inside the hedge maze seems a bit out of place.

When you learn a spell twice, the required mana supposedly goes down. I'm
not sure this happens if, say, you learn identification with your first
Collegium research session, then upon level 3 learn it again automatically.

It really should be easier for a new character to become lawful; at
least lawful enough for Athena or Odin to take note.

The bank really should give interest. Otherwise, what's the use? (besides
robbing it)

